2. Bxe4 f5 13. Bxc6 Nxc6 { Equal, and a little loose. }) (11... Nh7 { The knight goes backwards for no reason. } 12. Ng3 Ng5 13. Qh5 Nb7 { He is the one with a plan now. }) (11... Ne8 { Too humble. } 12. Ng3 Nd6 13. Nf5 Bxf5 { You untangle slowly and he is a touch better. }) 0-1


